# --- corpora that are not redistributed -------------------------------------
# TREC 2016 Total Recall (athome4) document collection: NIST usage agreement.
# Obtain from NIST and place at TREC/Jeb Bush TXT/<docno>.txt, then
# `bench trec-build` regenerates data/trec/{eval,dev,full}.jsonl.
# (anchored: on case-insensitive filesystems an unanchored `TREC/` would also
# swallow data/trec/)
/TREC/
# selective extraction of the eval-sample e-mails from the user's zip of the collection (ablation round 2); the zip itself too
data/trec/raw/jeb_bush_txt/
/data/TREC 2016 - Jeb Bush.zip
data/trec/*.jsonl
!data/trec/*_ids.jsonl
# CUAD upstream files: re-downloaded by `bench cuad-build`.
data/cuad/raw/
# EDRM Enron v2 text rendering (TREC Legal 2009/2010 Interactive collection), from
# trec-legal.umiacs.umd.edu/corpora/trec/legal10/. Not redistributed; the built
# corpora with text are not tracked either, only the NIST qrels under data/legal*/raw/.
/EDRM/
data/legal09/*.jsonl
!data/legal09/*_ids.jsonl
data/legal10/*.jsonl
# Learning-task qrels (102 MB gz, 325 MB plain; over GitHub's file limit): https://trec.nist.gov/data/legal/10/qrels.t10legallearn.gz
data/legal10/raw/qrels.t10legallearn*

# --- results ----------------------------------------------------------------
# Per-decision .jsonl records live in the GitHub Release (see results/README.md).
# Only aggregates are tracked: results/*.json, per-corpus summary*.json and
# REPORT.md, and results/trec_lat/sample_ids.json.
results/*
!results/.gitkeep
!results/README.md
!results/*.json
!results/*/
results/*/*
!results/*/summary*.json
!results/*/REPORT.md
!results/trec_lat/sample_ids.json
# the TAR reviewer-rate grids (`bench tar-grid`; aggregates, folded into results/tar_grid.json)
!results/tar_grid/*.json
results/**/*.jsonl
results_gpu*/

# contamination probe items contain document text from non-redistributed corpora
data/contam/*.jsonl
data/contam/raw/
!results/contam/contamination_report.html
!results/contam/paper.html
!results/contam/explainer.html
!results/contam/report_short.html
!results/contam/explainer_lawyer.html
!results/contam/verbatim_review.html
!results/contam/report_documents.html
!results/contam/report_case.html
!results/contam/story.html
!results/ablation/ablation_report.html
# Big Thorium: Relativity's synthetic aiR-for-Review demo workspace (RelativityOne ARM archive, ~1.5 GB zip, 1.6 GB unpacked).
# Provided by the user; not redistributed. `bench bigthorium extract` regenerates data/bigthorium/*.jsonl from the unpacked archive.
/Bigthorium_*.zip
data/bigthorium/raw/
data/bigthorium/derived/
# user's local copy of the raw TREC material
/Archive.zip
/Archive/
!data/bigthorium/raw/SOURCES.md
